{"id":"e811ef811223aaaa","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-kleene-O.md","title":"Kleene O 的最小正归纳系统","display":"df-kleene-O — Kleene O 的最小正归纳系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-kleene-O","aliases":["20-df-kleene-O"],"display":"df-kleene-O — Kleene O 的最小正归纳系统","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"definition-source-pending","source_reference":"既有 O 条目的规范化草案；Soare 2016 无此定义","depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-kleene-O"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-kleene-O</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kleene-O — Kleene O 的最小正归纳系统"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-source-pending"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"既有 O 条目的规范化草案；Soare 2016 无此定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(S\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}\\)</span> 为有限非空路径的传递闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(S,R)\">\\(L(S,R)\\)</span> 如显示式定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 definition-source-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,e,n\\in\\omega\">\\(a,b,e,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 为第一不可数序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\omega_1\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\omega_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 是待定义的秩映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}O}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nL(S,R):=\\{e:\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\omega\\land\n\\forall n\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\in S\\land(\\varphi_e(n),\\varphi_e(n+1))\\in R]\\},\\\\\nF_1(S,R):=S\\cup\\{1\\}\\cup\\{2^a:a\\in S\\}\\cup\\{3\\cdot5^e:e\\in L(S,R)\\},\\\\\nF_2(S,R):=\\operatorname{TC}\\!\\left(R\\cup\\{(a,2^a):a\\in S\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\varphi_e(n),3\\cdot5^e):e\\in L(S,R),n\\in\\omega\\}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathscr C:=\\{(S,R)\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):\nF_1(S,R)\\subseteq S\\land F_2(S,R)\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal O:=\\bigcap\\{S:\\exists R\\ [(S,R)\\in\\mathscr C]\\},\\qquad\n&lt;_\\mathcal O:=\\bigcap\\{R:\\exists S\\ [(S,R)\\in\\mathscr C]\\},\\\\\n&lt;_\\mathcal O\\ \\subseteq\\mathcal O\\times\\mathcal O,\\\\\n\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal O)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\ \\exists a\\in U\\ \\neg\\exists b\\in U\\ (b&lt;_\\mathcal Oa),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RankRec}(r)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nr\\in\\omega_1^{\\mathcal O}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O\\\n[r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in\\mathcal O\\land b&lt;_\\mathcal Oa\\}],\\\\\n\\exists!r\\ \\operatorname{RankRec}(r),\\\\\n|a|_\\mathcal O=\\alpha\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\na\\in\\mathcal O\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega_1\\land\\exists r\\ [\\operatorname{RankRec}(r)\\land r(a)=\\alpha].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}O}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nL(S,R):=\\{e:\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\omega\\land\n\\forall n\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\in S\\land(\\varphi_e(n),\\varphi_e(n+1))\\in R]\\},\\\\\nF_1(S,R):=S\\cup\\{1\\}\\cup\\{2^a:a\\in S\\}\\cup\\{3\\cdot5^e:e\\in L(S,R)\\},\\\\\nF_2(S,R):=\\operatorname{TC}\\!\\left(R\\cup\\{(a,2^a):a\\in S\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\varphi_e(n),3\\cdot5^e):e\\in L(S,R),n\\in\\omega\\}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathscr C:=\\{(S,R)\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):\nF_1(S,R)\\subseteq S\\land F_2(S,R)\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal O:=\\bigcap\\{S:\\exists R\\ [(S,R)\\in\\mathscr C]\\},\\qquad\n&lt;_\\mathcal O:=\\bigcap\\{R:\\exists S\\ [(S,R)\\in\\mathscr C]\\},\\\\\n&lt;_\\mathcal O\\ \\subseteq\\mathcal O\\times\\mathcal O,\\\\\n\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal O)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\ \\exists a\\in U\\ \\neg\\exists b\\in U\\ (b&lt;_\\mathcal Oa),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RankRec}(r)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nr\\in\\omega_1^{\\mathcal O}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O\\\n[r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in\\mathcal O\\land b&lt;_\\mathcal Oa\\}],\\\\\n\\exists!r\\ \\operatorname{RankRec}(r),\\\\\n|a|_\\mathcal O=\\alpha\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\na\\in\\mathcal O\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega_1\\land\\exists r\\ [\\operatorname{RankRec}(r)\\land r(a)=\\alpha].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}(R):=\\{(a,b)\\in\\omega^2:\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists c\\in\\omega^{n+1}\\\n[c(0)=a\\land c(n)=b\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((c(i),c(i+1))\\in R)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TC}(R):=\\{(a,b)\\in\\omega^2:\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists c\\in\\omega^{n+1}\\\n[c(0)=a\\land c(n)=b\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((c(i),c(i+1))\\in R)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个分量均按包含取最小不动点，生成规则和原编号不变。最小系统不含 0；其零记号 1、后继记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^a\">\\(2^a\\)</span>、极限记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\\cdot5^e\">\\(3\\cdot5^e\\)</span> 的形状互不混淆。每个新记号的生成前驱在更早的归纳阶段已形成；对已形成记号，后续阶段不增加新的基本前驱。有限传递路径因而严格向较早的生成阶段下降，这给出所写的良基条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 使每个前驱集合可数，良基递归唯一得到取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 的秩映射。</p>\n<p>这些说明用于定义的良定义性，不把不同同秩记号作商，也不把任意程序号当作有效极限记号。原有 definition-source-pending 状态保留：本次输入未提供书外原始来源，亦未提供证明助手中的独立证明证书；记号完备性不是本定义所补证的结论。</p>\n<p>来源：既有 O 条目的规范化草案；原元数据注明 Soare 2016 无此定义，本轮未作外部来源核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}","display":false},{"tex":"L(S,R)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,e,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}O}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nL(S,R):=\\{e:\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\omega\\land\n\\forall n\\ [\\varphi_e(n)\\in S\\land(\\varphi_e(n),\\varphi_e(n+1))\\in R]\\},\\\\\nF_1(S,R):=S\\cup\\{1\\}\\cup\\{2^a:a\\in S\\}\\cup\\{3\\cdot5^e:e\\in L(S,R)\\},\\\\\nF_2(S,R):=\\operatorname{TC}\\!\\left(R\\cup\\{(a,2^a):a\\in S\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\varphi_e(n),3\\cdot5^e):e\\in L(S,R),n\\in\\omega\\}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathscr C:=\\{(S,R)\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):\nF_1(S,R)\\subseteq S\\land F_2(S,R)\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal O:=\\bigcap\\{S:\\exists R\\ [(S,R)\\in\\mathscr C]\\},\\qquad\n<_\\mathcal O:=\\bigcap\\{R:\\exists S\\ [(S,R)\\in\\mathscr C]\\},\\\\\n<_\\mathcal O\\ \\subseteq\\mathcal O\\times\\mathcal O,\\\\\n\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal O)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\ \\exists a\\in U\\ \\neg\\exists b\\in U\\ (b<_\\mathcal Oa),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RankRec}(r)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nr\\in\\omega_1^{\\mathcal O}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O\\\n[r(a)=\\sup\\{r(b)+1:b\\in\\mathcal O\\land b<_\\mathcal Oa\\}],\\\\\n\\exists!r\\ \\operatorname{RankRec}(r),\\\\\n|a|_\\mathcal O=\\alpha\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\na\\in\\mathcal O\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega_1\\land\\exists r\\ [\\operatorname{RankRec}(r)\\land r(a)=\\alpha].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}(R):=\\{(a,b)\\in\\omega^2:\\exists n\\ge1\\ \\exists c\\in\\omega^{n+1}\\\n[c(0)=a\\land c(n)=b\\land\\forall i<n\\ ((c(i),c(i+1))\\in R)]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"2^a","display":false},{"tex":"3\\cdot5^e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":3390,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a7474d8b25c4444","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。"},{"id":"8bf8e68601202588","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-anal]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-kleene-O]]"},{"id":"4011ec29b6dff303","anchor":"ref-24","locations